# The ONE motir-core origin every cross-origin door on the landing is built
# from (MOTIR-1152). Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development.
#
# ⚠️ IT IS READ AT BUILD TIME, NOT AT RUNTIME. `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` values are
# INLINED into the bundle by `next build`, so setting this as a Fly SECRET
# would do nothing — the image would already have been built without it. The
# production value is passed to the image build by `fly.toml`'s
# `[build.args]`, and CI's own `Build` check sets it as a job env var.
#
# `lib/appOrigin.ts` throws `MotirAppOriginError` when it is missing or is not
# a bare http(s) origin, which fails the build with the variable's name rather
# than shipping three dead doors.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MOTIR_APP_ORIGIN=https://app.motir.co
